<title>USA: Breed Technologies Inc Q2 shr drops.</title>
<headline>Breed Technologies Inc Q2 shr drops.</headline>
<dateline>LAKELAND, Fla. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			   $0.10		    $0.57</p>
<p> Net			   3,150		   17,842</p>
<p> Revs			182,567		  105,655</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   31,640		   31,531</p>
<p>			6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			   $0.35		    $0.97</p>
<p> Net			  10,996		   30,443</p>
<p> Revs			341,238		  198,256</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   31,634		   31,522</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said Q2 included &quot;restructuring costs and other one-time charges, as well as a downturn of auto sales experienced by GM and Fiat.&quot;</p>
<p>It said that without &quot;these effects&quot; Breed would have earned about $0.30/shr.</p>
<p>It said Q2 also had net interest expenses related to acquisitions of $0.12/shr.</p>
<p>Period ended Dec 31.</p>
</text>
